**解** （法一）由题设知，$\Omega=\{(x,y,z)\mid (x,y)\in D_z,\,0\leqslant z\leqslant 1\}$，其中 $D_z=\{(x,y)\mid x^2+y^2\leqslant z\}$，且 $D_z$ 的面积为 $\pi z$，从而

$$
\bar{z}=\frac{\displaystyle\iiint_{\Omega}z\,\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y\mathrm{d}z}{\displaystyle\iiint_{\Omega}\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y\mathrm{d}z}
=\frac{\displaystyle\int_0^1 z\,\mathrm{d}z\iint_{D_z}\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y}{\displaystyle\int_0^1 \mathrm{d}z\iint_{D_z}\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y}
=\frac{\displaystyle\int_0^1 (z\cdot \pi z)\,\mathrm{d}z}{\displaystyle\int_0^1 \pi z\,\mathrm{d}z}
=\frac{\dfrac{\pi}{3}}{\dfrac{\pi}{2}}=\frac{2}{3}.
$$

（法二）由题设知，$\Omega=\{(x,y,z)\mid (x,y)\in D_{xy},\,x^2+y^2\leqslant z\leqslant 1\}$，其中 $D_{xy}=\{(x,y)\mid x^2+y^2\leqslant 1\}$，从而

$$
\bar{z}=\frac{\displaystyle\iiint_{\Omega}z\,\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y\mathrm{d}z}{\displaystyle\iiint_{\Omega}\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y\mathrm{d}z}
=\frac{\displaystyle\iint_{D_{xy}}\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y\int_{x^2+y^2}^{1} z\,\mathrm{d}z}{\displaystyle\iint_{D_{xy}}\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y\int_{x^2+y^2}^{1}\mathrm{d}z}
=\frac{\dfrac{1}{2}\displaystyle\iint_{D_{xy}}\left[1-(x^2+y^2)^2\right]\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y}{\displaystyle\iint_{D_{xy}}(1-x^2-y^2)\,\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{d}y}
$$

$$
